/T (become more significant as enterprise complexity increases. For an application such as the Enterprise Job Application Management System, standard functionality can be built quickly using low-code, while demanding requirements in logic, integration, security, scale and advanced technology may need pro-code extensions. It is therefore important to understand the limitations of a platform before selecting a development approach, so that the chosen approach matches the requirements of the enterprise application.)
/E (become more significant as enterprise complexity increases. For an application such as the Enterprise Job Application Management System, standard functionality can be built quickly using low-code, while demanding requirements in logic, integration, security, scale and advanced technology may need pro-code extensions. It is therefore important to understand the limitations of a platform before selecting a development approach, so that the chosen approach matches the requirements of the enterprise application.)
