403 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 50 0 R
/T (As the organisation grows, the requirements become more demanding. A large number of applicants, applications and records raises performance and data-management concerns; integration with CRM, HRMS and job portals raises integration concerns; differing access needs and the handling of applicant personal data raise security and governance concerns; and advanced features such as intelligent resume screening may need external services. In such cases, extensions, integrations or custom development may be needed in addition to the low-code application. Low-code is therefore useful for rapidly developing standard business applications, whereas increasingly complex enterprise requirements may call for a hybrid approach, and the choice should be based on the requirements of the application.)
/E (As the organisation grows, the requirements become more demanding. A large number of applicants, applications and records raises performance and data-management concerns; integration with CRM, HRMS and job portals raises integration concerns; differing access needs and the handling of applicant personal data raise security and governance concerns; and advanced features such as intelligent resume screening may need external services. In such cases, extensions, integrations or custom development may be needed in addition to the low-code application. Low-code is therefore useful for rapidly developing standard business applications, whereas increasingly complex enterprise requirements may call for a hybrid approach, and the choice should be based on the requirements of the application.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [34]
>>
